WEBVTT

00:00.310 --> 00:04.230
<b>Episode 5: Basketball Girl with Him</b>

00:17.910 --> 00:19.380
<i>Morning, beaut—</i>

00:24.540 --> 00:26.650
Ugh, it's raining?

00:29.590 --> 00:33.150
<i>Rainy mornings always get me down.</i>

00:33.150 --> 00:35.590
<i>Styling my hair takes longer,</i>

00:36.030 --> 00:38.940
<i>and my favorite loafers get all soaked.</i>

00:44.690 --> 00:46.850
<i>But today's different!</i>

00:46.850 --> 00:49.610
<i>Mm, I feel great!</i>

00:50.170 --> 00:52.530
<i>The glistening wet road to school</i>

00:52.840 --> 00:55.530
<i>feels almost like a red carpet 
welcoming a winner!</i>

00:56.020 --> 01:00.010
<i>And the sound of the raindrops feels like 
the applause directed at a champion!</i>

01:01.150 --> 01:06.170
I-I just got a bit startled 
because it was all so sudden.

01:06.440 --> 01:09.170
<i>It took a little while,</i>

01:09.170 --> 01:12.170
<i>but finally, at long last...</i>

01:12.170 --> 01:15.420
<i>Medaka is starting to succumb to me!</i>

01:21.560 --> 01:24.270
<i>Look, even fate is on my side.</i>

01:24.600 --> 01:28.330
<i>My reign as queen bee continues unchallenged!</i>

01:31.810 --> 01:32.960
Morning!

01:33.880 --> 01:36.820
I didn't know you took this way to school.

01:37.220 --> 01:38.110
What's wrong?

01:38.110 --> 01:40.410
Forget your umbrella?

01:41.540 --> 01:45.840
<i>Whenever I used to speak to him this way, 
Medaka would react like this:</i>

01:47.700 --> 01:49.840
<i>his eyebrows would get all scrunched.</i>

01:49.840 --> 01:51.150
<i>But now?</i>

01:53.290 --> 01:54.840
M-Morning.

01:54.840 --> 01:57.550
<i>See? He starts to scrunch up but doesn't!</i>

01:57.550 --> 02:00.680
I saw a cat and her kittens 
getting drenched in the rain.

02:00.980 --> 02:02.720
Gave them my umbrella.

02:09.070 --> 02:10.500
<i>Wait, no!</i>

02:12.250 --> 02:14.610
Oh, is that why? You're so sweet.

02:14.610 --> 02:17.110
But you'll be late for school 
if you wait for it to let up.

02:20.950 --> 02:21.700
Hey.

02:22.610 --> 02:24.690
Come in close. We'll share mine.

02:24.690 --> 02:25.880
Uh...

02:25.880 --> 02:28.210
Don't be shy. Come on.

02:28.210 --> 02:31.710
<i>The old him'd start glarin' daggers 
at me if I tried this, but now...</i>

02:35.400 --> 02:39.090
Doesn't that just mean all you 
gotta do is not fall for her?

02:39.400 --> 02:42.270
Do your teachings not include 
being nice to people?

02:44.250 --> 02:46.970
I... I'll hold the umbrella.

02:47.740 --> 02:50.980
Probably better if I do it, cause I'm taller.

02:50.980 --> 02:53.300
Thanks! Here.

02:54.340 --> 02:56.480
P-Pardon me.

02:59.710 --> 03:04.340
<i>H-Holy cow! This wouldn't've had a chance 
in hell of happenin' a few days ago!</i>

03:04.700 --> 03:09.170
<i>Linking arms is a no, but sharing 
an umbrella is okay, huh?</i>

03:09.170 --> 03:11.630
<i>I wonder where he draws the line.</i>

03:19.980 --> 03:24.670
<i>We're sharin' an umbrella with nobody around. 
I gotta make this count.</i>

03:24.670 --> 03:30.080
<i>I'll figure out where his line is 
and get as close to it as possible!</i>

03:30.080 --> 03:33.040
Kuroiwa-kun, your shoulder's getting wet.

03:33.040 --> 03:35.130
Don't worry about me.

03:35.130 --> 03:37.530
But what if you catch a cold?

03:37.530 --> 03:39.860
Let me scoot in a little.

03:41.340 --> 03:44.200
<i>So this is fine? Then...</i>

03:55.830 --> 03:59.790
<i>Okay, so that's a no? He's so hard to read.</i>

03:59.790 --> 04:01.840
Come on, get in here.

