06:25.890 --> 06:26.650
Nice!

06:26.650 --> 06:28.240
<i>Wow, she's good.</i>

06:29.300 --> 06:30.660
Get back!

06:30.660 --> 06:32.190
Don't give her a free look!

06:30.930 --> 06:33.380
Wow, that girl's really good.

06:33.380 --> 06:35.800
She's being double teamed the whole time.

06:35.800 --> 06:38.180
Who can even stop her?

06:38.180 --> 06:41.170
And she's still a first-year, too. 
It's amazing.

06:41.170 --> 06:42.420
Huh...

06:42.420 --> 06:45.710
She's like a rising star, huh? That's awesome.

06:45.710 --> 06:46.780
Keep at it!

07:05.400 --> 07:06.580
Asahi!

07:06.580 --> 07:08.490
Did she fall face-first?

07:09.070 --> 07:12.410
Huh? Kuroiwa-senpai and Kawai-senpai?

07:12.410 --> 07:15.070
Sorry about that! Are you okay?

07:15.070 --> 07:16.910
Y-Yeah, I'm fine.

07:19.220 --> 07:21.080
Th-Thanks.

07:24.420 --> 07:26.120
I apologize.

07:26.120 --> 07:28.030
I should be the one to apologize.

07:28.030 --> 07:29.220
Well, yeah.

07:29.220 --> 07:29.800
Huh?

07:29.800 --> 07:34.360
You could get hit by the ball there, 
and you're being a distraction.

07:34.360 --> 07:35.800
If you wanna watch, do it upstairs.

07:35.800 --> 07:38.280
Asahi, show our seniors more respect!

07:38.280 --> 07:39.810
Sorry, Senpai!

07:39.810 --> 07:43.170
I-It's okay. You're right, sorry.

07:43.170 --> 07:46.080
<i>She may ball out, but she's a real sourpuss.</i>

07:46.080 --> 07:48.190
We should get going, Kuroiwa-kun.

07:49.690 --> 07:50.820
Hm?

07:53.720 --> 07:57.240
I got a question or two I need you to 
answer... if you don't mind, please.

08:00.980 --> 08:03.100
What is Asahi doing?!

08:08.490 --> 08:10.680
Slow down! Would you stop dragging me?

08:11.740 --> 08:14.170
<i>Wh-What is </i>with<i> this girl?</i>

08:14.170 --> 08:14.990
Tell me.

08:16.120 --> 08:18.900
What's the story with you and Kuroiwa-senpai?

08:22.350 --> 08:24.920
<i>"What's the story"?</i>

08:25.730 --> 08:28.640
W-We're just classmates.

08:28.640 --> 08:33.240
Huh? You came to the gym with 
"just a classmate" first thing in the morning?

08:33.240 --> 08:34.970
That'd be unthinkable for me.

08:34.970 --> 08:37.240
You think?

08:37.520 --> 08:38.820
Also, look.

08:42.250 --> 08:44.580
I only see the one umbrella.

08:45.100 --> 08:47.860
Did you share it with 
Kuroiwa-senpai on the way?

08:47.860 --> 08:48.910
Yep.

08:50.000 --> 08:51.520
Whoa! What?!

08:51.520 --> 08:54.020
Are you and Kuroiwa-senpai going out?

08:54.340 --> 08:55.470
Wha?

08:55.470 --> 08:58.670
Give it to me straight! Yes or no?

08:58.670 --> 09:01.620
N-No... We're not going out.

09:01.620 --> 09:04.060
<i>I can't believe this girl just asked me that!</i>

09:04.060 --> 09:08.170
I could never share an umbrella with 
some guy who wasn't my boyfriend.

09:08.170 --> 09:13.320
Oh, that just kinda happened. Kuroiwa-kun 
didn't have one, so I helped him out.

09:15.380 --> 09:19.720
Do you like him, then? That'd make sense.

09:19.720 --> 09:20.990
Again, no!

09:21.380 --> 09:22.220
B-But...

09:22.220 --> 09:24.620
Stop bothering her already, Asahi.

09:24.620 --> 09:26.810
Sorry about that, Mona-senpai.

09:26.810 --> 09:28.000
Hey, I'm not—

09:28.000 --> 09:30.120
You're coming with us, sheesh.

09:28.000 --> 09:30.120
What is wrong with you?!

09:30.120 --> 09:31.880
<i>What was that all about?</i>

09:39.390 --> 09:43.130
Did you know that first-year girl just now?

09:43.130 --> 09:44.820
Which ones were first-years?

09:45.140 --> 09:47.230
<i>So Medaka doesn't know her.</i>

09:47.230 --> 09:49.700
<i>But she knew his name, right?</i>

09:49.700 --> 09:52.650
<i>And I don't think he particularly stands out.</i>

09:53.430 --> 09:55.650
<i>Wait, does that Asahi girl...</i>

09:55.950 --> 09:59.660
<i>Was she grillin' me because she likes him?!</i>

09:59.660 --> 10:03.660
<i>Nobody'd do that on the first 
meeting otherwise, right?</i>

10:05.800 --> 10:08.580
Sorry, I think I'll go change first.

10:13.860 --> 10:17.010
<i>I'm the one puttin' the moves 
on Medaka right now.</i>

10:17.010 --> 10:18.930
<i>Is she gonna get in my way?</i>

10:19.210 --> 10:20.930
<i>That Asahi girl...</i>

10:21.450 --> 10:23.770
<i>Just what is her deal?!</i>

10:26.430 --> 10:28.420
Asahi Shonan?

10:29.070 --> 10:31.340
Yeah, I know of her. She's pretty popular.

10:31.340 --> 10:33.020
Wait, is she <i>famous</i>?

10:36.120 --> 10:40.000
That serious expression 
was good too, but this is cuter!

10:40.000 --> 10:43.380
So what's this Asahi Shonan like?

10:43.380 --> 10:47.250
Sh-She's already the star of our 
basketball team as a first-year. Look.

10:47.250 --> 10:48.920
She even made the news.

10:47.250 --> 10:49.370
<b>Rookie Makes Splash</b>

10:47.250 --> 10:49.370
<b>High School Basketball News</b>

10:49.370 --> 10:52.190
<i>Whoa, she's a hot prospect.</i>

10:52.190 --> 10:54.560
Is that from the latest game?

10:54.560 --> 10:56.880
My friends and I went to cheer.

10:57.290 --> 10:59.560
Asahi-chan really stole the show.

10:59.560 --> 11:02.360
She's smart, too. Top of the grade.

11:02.990 --> 11:05.720
R-Really? That's awesome.

11:05.720 --> 11:10.520
You're the peppy, cutesy type. 
On the other hand, she's a cool beauty.

11:10.520 --> 11:13.230
It's great how she doesn't let 
upperclassmen boss her around, too.

11:13.230 --> 11:16.680
Even the cold-shoulder treatment 
can be a blessing to fans.

11:16.680 --> 11:18.860
O-Oh yeah?

11:18.860 --> 11:22.860
<i>Yikes. Yeah, even I thought she was cool.</i>

11:23.260 --> 11:26.040
<i>It's bad news if a girl like her 
has feelings for Medaka.</i>

11:26.830 --> 11:29.470
<i>Nah, we don't know for sure yet.</i>

11:29.470 --> 11:32.330
<i>It ain't like Medaka even seems to know her.</i>

11:32.640 --> 11:34.240
<i>I should stop thinking about it.</i>

11:34.240 --> 11:37.560
<i>I'll be the one to charm 
his socks off, anyway.</i>

11:37.560 --> 11:39.850
Mona-chan, you've got a visitor.

11:39.850 --> 11:42.180
Okay, thanks.

11:42.810 --> 11:44.970
I'm here. Who is it?

11:48.820 --> 11:49.700
Heya.

11:50.270 --> 11:53.030
<i>Urk, Asahi?!</i>

11:53.410 --> 11:55.810
Wh-What's up?

11:55.810 --> 11:58.530
We didn't get to finish 
our conversation this morning.

12:04.320 --> 12:06.070
<i>M-Medaka?!</i>

12:07.700 --> 12:12.620
<i>C-Crap! It'd be bad if she started askin' me 
about likin' him or datin' him again!</i>

12:12.620 --> 12:15.130
L-Let's talk elsewhere, Shonan-san!

12:18.440 --> 12:21.360
Huh? Aren't you Asahi Shonan?

12:22.750 --> 12:24.920
Is it just me, or is she acting kinda strange?

12:29.210 --> 12:30.840
<i>Huh? Who's this now?</i>

12:31.610 --> 12:34.230
Oh, the girl who was killing it 
at basketball earlier?

12:44.320 --> 12:45.660
<i>Her panties!</i>

12:52.090 --> 12:54.870
<i>She turned into a different person 
as soon as Medaka spoke up.</i>

12:55.290 --> 12:57.790
<i>What happened to her bossy attitude?!</i>

12:57.790 --> 13:00.540
<i>She's totally crushin' on him!</i>

13:01.530 --> 13:03.010
I won't lose.

13:09.160 --> 13:10.180
<i>Did...</i>

13:10.180 --> 13:13.980
<i>Did she just declare war?!</i>

13:16.600 --> 13:18.980
