14:26.750 --> 14:28.910
You too, Shonan-san.

14:28.910 --> 14:31.220
<i>Wh-What's with that coy act of hers?!</i>

14:31.480 --> 14:35.390
<i>How hard can it be to say "good morning"? 
How did she even flub that?</i>

14:35.390 --> 14:38.230
<i>The panty flash yesterday, too. 
She's panderin' too hard!</i>

14:38.490 --> 14:39.920
<i>I can't be outdone.</i>

14:39.920 --> 14:43.310
Let's go inside. Homeroom's about to start.

