<i>I was just starting to make progress, too!</i>

15:30.680 --> 15:33.870
<i>This is the worst time to get in my way!</i>

15:34.870 --> 15:38.120
Kuroiwa-senpai was just the coolest.

15:38.440 --> 15:42.580
You got aggressive all of a sudden. 
Is it the Mona-senpai effect?

15:42.920 --> 15:46.980
She said they're not dating 
and that she doesn't like him either.

15:46.980 --> 15:50.170
If she's not into him, then that's your chance.

15:50.460 --> 15:53.020
But you gotta start with 
getting him to know you.

15:53.020 --> 15:56.240
I get so nervous around him, though.

15:56.240 --> 15:58.180
Yeah, that's the stuff!

15:58.570 --> 15:59.710
Whoa.

16:00.430 --> 16:04.140
This feels so much sexier than full-on nudity.

16:04.140 --> 16:05.290
Right?

16:05.690 --> 16:07.390
Gross.

16:08.390 --> 16:10.840
Boys sure do love that stuff.

16:10.840 --> 16:13.490
Sneak peeks that leave the rest 
to the imagination? Or something?

16:13.800 --> 16:15.000
Oh?

16:18.430 --> 16:19.390
All right.

16:19.390 --> 16:22.040
Split up into boys and girls and get started.

16:22.350 --> 16:24.560
Yessir.

16:22.530 --> 16:26.540
<i>Why's gym class have to be 
basketball of all things?</i>

16:28.850 --> 16:33.210
<i>Anyway, that speed bump 
isn't around right now.</i>

16:34.180 --> 16:40.880
<i>I'm gonna overwrite your "basketball girl" 
memory in Medaka's mind, Asahi Shonan!</i>

16:41.720 --> 16:43.150
Mona-chan in a ponytail!

16:43.150 --> 16:44.850
Viva P.E.!

16:44.850 --> 16:47.540
Every hairstyle looks good on her.

16:47.540 --> 16:49.860
And damn, what a bangin' bod!

16:49.860 --> 16:52.860
<i>Let me take a pic later, Mona-chan!</i>

17:03.250 --> 17:04.120
Medaka!

17:11.690 --> 17:12.960
Medaka?!

17:13.880 --> 17:17.090
<i>He's not great at basketball, huh?</i>

17:19.350 --> 17:22.430
<i>Star of the basketball team? So what?</i>

17:22.430 --> 17:26.190
<i>You want a fight? 
I'll bring you one on your own turf!</i>

17:29.190 --> 17:30.820
Bravo!

17:34.190 --> 17:39.270
<i>Booyah! Behold a special kind of charm 
that only appears when I go all-out!</i>

17:39.700 --> 17:45.860
<i>You picked the wrong girl to mess with, 
Asahi Shonan. I'm not just cuteness overload.</i>

17:45.860 --> 17:52.210
<i>Mona Kawai is a cutie-pie who's </i>also<i> 
perfect at everything she does!</i>

17:55.750 --> 17:58.220
<i>You ain't ever beatin' me.</i>

18:07.480 --> 18:09.240
Mona-chan's cute <i>and</i> awe-inspiring.

18:09.240 --> 18:12.110
