18:35.260 --> 18:38.830
Sorry. I gotta head out ASAP too.

18:45.140 --> 18:47.520
They're all so mean.

18:49.140 --> 18:50.980
You don't wanna lose again, do you?

18:51.240 --> 18:54.110
Want me to help you practice your shot?

18:56.730 --> 19:00.240
I'll even clean up with you, so go on.

19:00.930 --> 19:03.660
Practice. Let me take a look 
at your shooting form.

19:04.030 --> 19:06.580
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit!</i>

19:07.420 --> 19:09.050
Please do, then.

19:17.000 --> 19:19.880
This is the angle you need.

19:23.170 --> 19:25.680
<i>Th-They're... They're pressing up against me!</i>

19:25.680 --> 19:30.040
<i>How's that? I call it Operation 
Extra Extracurricular Activities!</i>

19:30.040 --> 19:31.560
Try shooting this way.

19:35.020 --> 19:37.950
<i>C-Clear mind, clear spirit!</i>

19:37.950 --> 19:40.450
<i>M-Mona-chan's only coaching me!</i>

19:40.450 --> 19:43.290
I think you're a little too tense.

19:43.290 --> 19:46.880
<i>Where there's a will... Guts and 
fortitude... Calm and collected...</i>

19:46.880 --> 19:48.490
<i>I am mu, the void.</i>

19:48.490 --> 19:50.910
<i>Mu, the void. Mu, the void.</i>

19:50.910 --> 19:53.620
Point your fingertips toward the basket.

19:50.910 --> 19:54.190
<i>Mu... Void... Mu... Void...</i>

19:54.190 --> 19:55.670
<i>Boobs... buoyed?!</i>

19:55.670 --> 19:58.030
<i>I... I might be pushin' it here.</i>

19:58.030 --> 20:02.510
<i>But he's not showin' much of a reaction, 
and I can't see his face!</i>

20:02.510 --> 20:05.140
<i>Is this workin'?</i>

20:05.140 --> 20:06.140
What are you doing?

20:09.310 --> 20:11.260
<i>A-Asahi?!</i>

20:11.260 --> 20:14.560
W-We're just refining his shot.

20:14.860 --> 20:16.160
Right? Right?

20:16.160 --> 20:17.520
Y-Yeah...

20:17.520 --> 20:20.860
<i>I was just getting to the good part!</i>

20:20.860 --> 20:21.910
...him.

20:22.850 --> 20:24.740
So you <i>do</i> like him!

20:26.170 --> 20:28.740
Shh! I told you, it's not like that!

20:28.740 --> 20:31.140
It doesn't make sense otherwise!

20:31.140 --> 20:33.420
Why would you cling like that 
to a boy you don't like?!

20:33.420 --> 20:36.590
I was just trying to help Kuroiwa-kun out.

20:38.530 --> 20:41.030
In that case, I could coach him too, right?

20:41.780 --> 20:44.810
W-Watch this, Kuroiwa-senpai!

20:46.640 --> 20:49.540
Muscles and core strength are key for shooting.

20:49.540 --> 20:51.560
Let's do some planks together!

20:51.860 --> 20:54.230
Right now! Please!

20:54.230 --> 20:56.080
O-Okay.

20:59.360 --> 21:00.900
L-Like this?

21:05.950 --> 21:08.320
<i>Wh-What's with that reaction?</i>

21:12.580 --> 21:14.830
<i>Is </i>that<i> her game?!</i>

21:17.250 --> 21:18.250
Kuroiwa-senpai—

21:18.250 --> 21:19.340
Kuroiwa-kun.

21:24.590 --> 21:27.340
You gotta maintain the correct form for planks.

21:27.340 --> 21:29.670
Watch me closely.

21:30.100 --> 21:33.130
C-Clear mind, clear spirit... 
Where there's a will...

21:33.130 --> 21:35.100
Calm and collected... Firm and unshakable!

21:36.170 --> 21:37.690
Kuroiwa-senpai!

21:38.830 --> 21:42.480
Do... Do you dislike smaller sizes?

22:02.050 --> 22:06.380
<i>What the hell was I thinking? 
That crossed the line!</i>

22:09.110 --> 22:11.140
<i>What the hell was I thinkin'?</i>

22:11.500 --> 22:14.970
<i>That crossed the line and then some!</i>

23:44.940 --> 23:49.940
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

23:44.940 --> 23:49.940
<b>Episode 6





Nursing with Him</b>

23:46.900 --> 23:49.740
Next time: "Nursing with Him."
